{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a NEW standalone English Limited Deals block; never edit or replace existing blocks. Reference the old block: pale #F8F9FD background, white cards, #111111 text, yellow #FFF002 countdown and buttons, 12px corners. Default copy: Flash Sale; GKU Weekly Flash Sale; Save up to 40% on this week's selected dash cams. Limited-time offers.; Shop Now. Place live countdown at the entire block's TOP RIGHT beside the header, with editable label and end datetime. Stack two selectable COLLECTION grids vertically. Each collection needs independent editable main title and subtitle at its top left, independent desktop columns 1-6 and mobile columns 1-2, and independent discount percentage. Display computed sale price and crossed-out pre-discount price using corresponding variant prices and store currency. Include editable promotional description and badge text. Add separate color controls for sale price, original price, badge text and badge background. All copy and editor labels/help must be English. Explain discounts are display-only; actual matching checkout discounts must be configured separately. Keep the original block untouched so the merchant can compare previews., “Keep everything else unchanged. Increase only the top-right countdown size by about 25%, including its numbers and padding. Keep it in the top-right corner on desktop and prevent overflow on mobile. Add a countdown size setting.”, “Change only the countdown appearance to four separate bright-yellow rounded tiles in one horizontal row, matching the reference image. Each tile shows a large bold black two-digit number above a small uppercase label: DAYS, HOURS, MINUTES, SECONDS. Use compact, even gaps between tiles. Keep the countdown at the top-right of the entire block and preserve the existing countdown size control and end-time setting. Scale the tiles together when adjusting size, and prevent overflow on mobile. Keep all other content, colors, collection settings, discounts, and layout unchanged.”, “Add one button at the very bottom of the entire block, below both collection sections. Add editable settings named ‘Bottom button label’ and ‘Bottom button link’, so I can choose its text and destination URL. Hide the button when either field is blank. Match the existing button style. Keep everything else unchanged.”, “Change only the bottom button to a compact, left-aligned button beneath the collection grids, aligned with their left edge. Use content-based width, not full width, with approximately 28px horizontal padding and 12px vertical padding. Keep it left-aligned and compact on mobile. Preserve its existing label, link, colors, and all other block content and layout.”, “Fix the existing bottom button, which is still stretching across the full row. Inspect both the button and its parent container for full-width or stretch styles. Make the clickable button itself inline-flex with width: fit-content, flex: 0 0 auto, and align-self: flex-start. Set its wrapper to left-align without stretching the button. Only the compact button should have the yellow background, not the full-width wrapper. Keep 28px horizontal and 12px vertical padding. Preserve the existing label, link, colors, and everything else.”
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};border-radius:12px;padding:28px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }} *, .ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::before,.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::after{box-sizing:border-box}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:20px;margin-bottom:22px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{display:inline-block;margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin:0 0 8px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.15}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:.45em;flex:0 1 auto;width:max-content;max-width:100%;background:transparent;color:#111;font-size:{{ block.settings.countdown_size }}px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer-label{font-size:.65em;font-weight:700}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer-tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.3em;width:100%;max-width:100%}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile{display:flex;min-width:0;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.08em;padding:.45em .35em;border-radius:.45em;background:{{ block.settings.countdown_color }};color:#111;text-align:center}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number{font-size:1em;font-weight:800;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1.05}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__unit{font-size:.38em;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.035em;line-height:1.15}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection{margin-top:24px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection-head{margin-bottom:14px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection-title{margin:0 0 4px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:22px;line-height:1.25}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection-subtitle{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(var(--desktop-columns),minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{min-width:0;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;color:#111;border-radius:12px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-link{display:block;position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1;background:#fff}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-link img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{width:100%;height:100%}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;background:#f4f4f4}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;max-width:calc(100% - 20px);padding:6px 9px;border-radius:6px;background:{{ block.settings.badge_background }};color:{{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};font-size:12px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card-body{padding:13px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title{display:block;margin:0 0 7px;color:#111;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description{margin:0 0 9px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin-bottom:11px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sale-price{color:{{ block.settings.sale_price_color }};font-weight:800;font-size:17px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__original-price{color:{{ block.settings.original_price_color }};font-size:13px;text-decoration:line-through}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button{display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:42px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:{{ block.settings.countdown_color }};color:#111;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;text-decoration:none}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:focus-visible,.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title:focus-visible,.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #111;outline-offset:3px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty{padding:18px;border:1px dashed #777;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__note{margin:22px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom-cta{display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:flex-start;align-self:stretch;width:100%;max-width:100%;margin-top:22px;background:transparent;text-align:left}
.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom-cta .ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button{display:inline-flex;width:fit-content;max-width:100%;flex:0 0 auto;align-self:flex-start;justify-content:center;margin:0;padding:12px 28px}
@media(max-width:749px){.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:18px}.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top{flex-direction:column;gap:14px}.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer{align-self:flex-end;width:min(100%,17em);font-size:min({{ block.settings.countdown_size }}px,5vw)}.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer-tiles{gap:.25em}.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile{padding:.4em .2em}.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__unit{font-size:.34em}.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(var(--mobile-columns),minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card-body{padding:10px}.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title{font-size:13px}.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom-cta{justify-content:flex-start;align-items:flex-start}.ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom-cta .ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button{width:fit-content;flex:0 0 auto;align-self:flex-start;padding:12px 28px}}
{% endstyle %}
<limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-ends-at="{{ block.settings.end_datetime | escape }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top"><div>{% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}<p class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>{% endif %}<h2 class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2><p class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro">{{ block.settings.intro | escape }}</p></div><div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer" role="timer" aria-live="off"><span class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer-label">{{ block.settings.countdown_label | escape }}</span><div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timer-tiles"><div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile"><span class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number" data-days>00</span><span class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__unit">DAYS</span></div><div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile"><span class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number" data-hours>00</span><span class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__unit">HOURS</span></div><div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile"><span class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number" data-minutes>00</span><span class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__unit">MINUTES</span></div><div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile"><span class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__number" data-seconds>00</span><span class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__unit">SECONDS</span></div></div></div></div>
{% for i in (1..2) %}{% liquid
assign collection_key='collection_' | append:i
assign title_key='collection_' | append:i | append:'_title'
assign subtitle_key='collection_' | append:i | append:'_subtitle'
assign desktop_key='collection_' | append:i | append:'_desktop_columns'
assign mobile_key='collection_' | append:i | append:'_mobile_columns'
assign discount_key='collection_' | append:i | append:'_discount'
assign selected_collection=block.settings[collection_key]
assign section_title=block.settings[title_key]
assign section_subtitle=block.settings[subtitle_key]
assign desktop_columns=block.settings[desktop_key]
assign mobile_columns=block.settings[mobile_key]
assign discount_percent=block.settings[discount_key]
%}<section class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection" aria-label="{{ section_title | escape }}"><div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection-head"><h3 class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection-title">{{ section_title | escape }}</h3>{% if section_subtitle != blank %}<p class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__collection-subtitle">{{ section_subtitle | escape }}</p>{% endif %}</div>{% if selected_collection != blank and selected_collection.products.size > 0 %}<div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid" style="--desktop-columns:{{ desktop_columns }};--mobile-columns:{{ mobile_columns }}">{% for deal_product in selected_collection.products limit:24 %}{% assign deal_variant=deal_product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}{% if deal_variant %}{% assign original_price=deal_variant.price %}{% assign discount_amount=original_price | times:discount_percent | divided_by:100 %}{% assign sale_price=original_price | minus:discount_amount %}<article class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><a class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image-link" href="{{ deal_product.url }}?variant={{ deal_variant.id }}" aria-label="{{ deal_product.title | escape }}">{% if deal_product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ deal_product.featured_image | image_url:width:700 }}" alt="{{ deal_product.featured_image.alt | default:deal_product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ deal_product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ deal_product.featured_image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.badge_text != blank %}<span class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ block.settings.badge_text | escape }}</span>{% endif %}</a><div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card-body"><a class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title" href="{{ deal_product.url }}?variant={{ deal_variant.id }}">{{ deal_product.title | escape }}</a>{% if block.settings.promo_description != blank %}<p class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ block.settings.promo_description | escape }}</p>{% endif %}<div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices"><span class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__sale-price">{{ sale_price | money_with_currency }}</span><s class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__original-price">{{ original_price | money_with_currency }}</s></div><a class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button" href="{{ deal_product.url }}?variant={{ deal_variant.id }}">{{ block.settings.button_label | escape }}</a></div></article>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Choose a collection in the block settings to show products here.</div>{% endif %}</section>{% endfor %}
<p class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__note">{{ block.settings.discount_note | escape }}</p>
{% if block.settings.bottom_button_label != blank and block.settings.bottom_button_link != blank %}<div class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom-cta"><a class="ai-limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button" href="{{ block.settings.bottom_button_link }}">{{ block.settings.bottom_button_label | escape }}</a></div>{% endif %}
</limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(()=>{const tag='limited-deals-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class LimitedDeals extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.parts={days:this.querySelector('[data-days]'),hours:this.querySelector('[data-hours]'),minutes:this.querySelector('[data-minutes]'),seconds:this.querySelector('[data-seconds]')};this.end=Date.parse(this.dataset.endsAt);this.tick();this.interval=window.setInterval(()=>this.tick(),1000)}disconnectedCallback(){window.clearInterval(this.interval)}tick(){let left=Math.max(0,Math.floor((this.end-Date.now())/1000));if(!Number.isFinite(left))left=0;const values={days:Math.floor(left/86400),hours:Math.floor(left%86400/3600),minutes:Math.floor(left%3600/60),seconds:left%60};Object.keys(values).forEach(key=>{this.parts[key].textContent=String(values[key]).padStart(2,'0')});if(left===0)window.clearInterval(this.interval)}}customElements.define(tag,LimitedDeals)})();</script>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Limited deals","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"header","content":"Header and countdown"},{"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"Flash Sale"},{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Main heading","default":"GKU Weekly Flash Sale"},{"type":"textarea","id":"intro","label":"Intro text","default":"Save up to 40% on this week's selected dash cams. Limited-time offers."},{"type":"text","id":"countdown_label","label":"Countdown label","default":"Ends in"},{"type":"text","id":"end_datetime","label":"End date and time","info":"Enter a date and time including timezone, for example 2026-12-31T23:59:00+08:00."},{"type":"range","id":"countdown_size","label":"Countdown size","min":16,"max":32,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":20},{"type":"header","content":"First collection"},{"type":"collection","id":"collection_1","label":"Collection"},{"type":"text","id":"collection_1_title","label":"Main title","default":"Featured deals"},{"type":"text","id":"collection_1_subtitle","label":"Subtitle","default":"Explore this collection's limited-time offers."},{"type":"select","id":"collection_1_desktop_columns","label":"Desktop columns","options":[{"value":"1","label":"1"},{"value":"2","label":"2"},{"value":"3","label":"3"},{"value":"4","label":"4"},{"value":"5","label":"5"},{"value":"6","label":"6"}],"default":"4"},{"type":"select","id":"collection_1_mobile_columns","label":"Mobile columns","options":[{"value":"1","label":"1"},{"value":"2","label":"2"}],"default":"2"},{"type":"range","id":"collection_1_discount","label":"Display discount","min":5,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":20},{"type":"header","content":"Second collection"},{"type":"collection","id":"collection_2","label":"Collection"},{"type":"text","id":"collection_2_title","label":"Main title","default":"More limited deals"},{"type":"text","id":"collection_2_subtitle","label":"Subtitle","default":"Shop more selected dash cams at a special displayed price."},{"type":"select","id":"collection_2_desktop_columns","label":"Desktop columns","options":[{"value":"1","label":"1"},{"value":"2","label":"2"},{"value":"3","label":"3"},{"value":"4","label":"4"},{"value":"5","label":"5"},{"value":"6","label":"6"}],"default":"4"},{"type":"select","id":"collection_2_mobile_columns","label":"Mobile columns","options":[{"value":"1","label":"1"},{"value":"2","label":"2"}],"default":"2"},{"type":"range","id":"collection_2_discount","label":"Display discount","min":5,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":20},{"type":"header","content":"Product card content"},{"type":"text","id":"promo_description","label":"Promotional description","default":"Limited-time collection offer."},{"type":"text","id":"badge_text","label":"Badge text","default":"Limited deal"},{"type":"text","id":"button_label","label":"Button label","default":"Shop Now"},{"type":"text","id":"discount_note","label":"Discount note","default":"Displayed discounts are for presentation only. Configure matching discounts separately in Shopify so the offer applies at checkout."},{"type":"text","id":"bottom_button_label","label":"Bottom button label"},{"type":"url","id":"bottom_button_link","label":"Bottom button link"},{"type":"header","content":"Colors"},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Block background","default":"#F8F9FD"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Main text","default":"#111111"},{"type":"color","id":"countdown_color","label":"Countdown and button","default":"#FFF002"},{"type":"color","id":"sale_price_color","label":"Sale price","default":"#111111"},{"type":"color","id":"original_price_color","label":"Original price","default":"#595959"},{"type":"color","id":"badge_text_color","label":"Badge text","default":"#111111"},{"type":"color","id":"badge_background","label":"Badge background","default":"#FFF002"}],"presets":[{"name":"Limited deals"}],"tag":null,"class":"limited-deals-standalone"}
{% endschema %}